<description>&lt;p&gt;ELN guerrillas used armed drones to kill a Colombian soldier and the Colombian Air Force bombed a guerrilla camp, killing at least three combatants, while FARC also operates armed drones. A stadium collapse in Colombia killed at least four people and a major earthquake has caused more than 224 deaths, with rescue operations ongoing. Russian forces struck a deployment hub in Ukraine used by Colombian mercenaries. The United Nations urged De la Espriella to uphold the peace agreement and a U.S. indictment revived former FARC leader Timochenko's name in a Venezuelan case. 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168580&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirAFBVV95cUxOZ3pOazJ3ZVd1VmNoV2RNakxad28xeW1qUXo1TU9hRU9iTUI4V19DblFUaXFJT1k1UGY3NUItZTNCUk1SZHRtOVJIYWtXQlpFMEpmWnd3dUFWa3AxYlhSa3VtOENKVUJjZHpGVDhzT1VFd3llaWFteFYtRmM3Qk5xMmIxeW1VSUFMQV9nZmZGWGNLSUlXOVlJUkpQSWlHRndJN3JId3NJaVRjVnVq?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Taiwan Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxOYzQyakJyaXhEcHg3LVU3ZlhBczBIeE5ZTWotTVVJR0oxQ2ppdlF6dTBtQmV4TWJQYjZJcnIxU0tFSmVCV1I2V25aenp6TGt1c2hYTGNkWnZwTTBua19kczQxLXBSMVlMQkxRaEVUWGtsQ211Z0NJd0wzMWcyZTNObnVVUms?oc=5&quot;&gt;조선일보&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPY290TGg0RWV3UVZCenVsNlYtS2hwRXR2OFdDcTNrYUVpMG5VVmlXazVnY0MzSTJIMmdHZ2lJTzhNVFlZaGdtMEVhUmhiVHdvTDVSWkt2S2VEN0RBOThuQ2hmWE4tSGVncFMwR3lxR3BoVGY5T0xubWxnVTB5WnNUdjFPQTB5Zw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mirage News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNYkUtWWVOWGUzMWlLaTU5SDV4Q1phdGhINVlOS2pyVWFoN1ZDOHZ6cE5nYkZVWkJnSjhHTzJnUWN6MFJ3TDZFQm9kZFJrdW9UczI4akRjUmpQYkdwZXd0ZEM0ZDFYZmhJVUFEMlRkYm0wOW1fOFY0MlZ5ejBUbE